        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The hero of the game is a courageous young boy and you must lead him through various worlds full of obstacles to retrieve his stolen goldfish called Flipper!\n\nThe game features beautiful pixel-art backdrops, cheerful cartoon characters and catchy music. The voxel engine technology allows you to change the environment with some cool power-ups. You can find power-ups that let you blast holes in the environment, build platforms, or restore parts you've previously destroyed. It's up to you to use the limited amount of power-ups wisely to complete each level.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El protagonista es un valiente niño, y debes guiarlo por diversos mundos llenos de obstáculos para recuperar su pez dorado robado, llamado Flipper.\n\nEl juego cuenta con fondos de pixel art preciosos, personajes de dibujos animados alegres y música pegadiza. La tecnología de motor voxel te permite cambiar el entorno con algunos potenciadores geniales. Puedes encontrar potenciadores que te permiten abrir agujeros en el entorno, construir plataformas o restaurar partes que destruiste antes. Depende de ti usar con sabiduría la cantidad limitada de potenciadores para completar cada nivel.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
